  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, it’s you! Thank you again for giving me that\nPikachu back then.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006900742019007300200079006F007500210020005400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200061006700610069006E00200066006F007200200067006900760069006E00670020006D006500200074006800610074000A00500069006B00610063006800750020006200610063006B0020007400680065006E002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thunder Stones really are wondrous, aren’t they?\nI just adore my Raichu!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alola!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F006C00610021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And thanks for the Pokémon trade, of course! The\nRaichu you gave me is such a delight.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But today, the two of us aren’t here to ask you for\nanother favor—but rather to do one for you.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Because we’re here to show you...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420065006300610075007300650020007700652019007200650020006800650072006500200074006F002000730068006F007700200079006F0075002E002E002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Raichu’s Mega Evolutions!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005200610069006300680075201900730020004D006500670061002000450076006F006C007500740069006F006E00730021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We can’t show off Mega Evolution without a\nbattle, so let us know when you’re ready for one!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you ready to battle us so we can show off our\nMega-Evolved Raichu duo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you ready to battle us so we can show off our\nMega-Evolved Raichu duo?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200072006500610064007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh gosh, really? But I’m just dying to show you\nmy Raichu’s Mega Evolution!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then allow us to demonstrate...in battle! Behold\nthe Mega Evolutions of Raichu!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And I really wanted to show you MY Mega-\nEvolved Raichu!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000490020007200650061006C006C0079002000770061006E00740065006400200074006F002000730068006F007700200079006F00750020004D00590020004D006500670061002D000A00450076006F006C00760065006400200052006100690063006800750021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, we’ll certainly show you how Raichu can\nMega Evolve in this battle!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look! Our Raichu!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F006F006B00210020004F007500720020005200610069006300680075002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re both so big! They’re alpha-sized!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065007920190072006500200062006F0074006800200073006F002000620069006700210020005400680065007920190072006500200061006C007000680061002D00730069007A006500640021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Transform into Mega Raichu X and let loose the\nelectromagnetism from your twin tails!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allow me to battle you on behalf of the\nMega Raichu Y Promotion Committee!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No wonder you came out on top—you’re an\namazing Z-A Royale Trainer!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200077006F006E00640065007200200079006F0075002000630061006D00650020006F007500740020006F006E00200074006F007020140079006F007520190072006500200061006E000A0061006D0061007A0069006E00670020005A002D004100200052006F00790061006C006500200054007200610069006E00650072002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That was just what I’d expect from the Trainer\nwho saved Lumiose City from certain doom.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>It seems we’ve got to thank you once again,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000004900740020007300650065006D007300200077006520190076006500200067006F007400200074006F0020007400680061006E006B00200079006F00750020006F006E0063006500200061006700610069006E002C000A0010000201000000002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s thanks to you that our Raichu duo was born.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490074201900730020007400680061006E006B007300200074006F00200079006F0075002000740068006100740020006F007500720020005200610069006300680075002000640075006F002000770061007300200062006F0072006E002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As an expression of my appreciation, I’d like to\ngift you with this Raichunite X stone...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And please have this Raichunite Y stone from me!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400200070006C006500610073006500200068006100760065002000740068006900730020005200610069006300680075006E00690074006500200059002000730074006F006E0065002000660072006F006D0020006D00650021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>I hope we meet again someday,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000004900200068006F007000650020007700650020006D00650065007400200061006700610069006E00200073006F006D0065006400610079002C000A0010000201000000002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alola!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F006C00610021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! If it isn’t <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> again!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680021002000490066002000690074002000690073006E201900740020001000020100000000200061006700610069006E002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What fantastic timing! We were actually just\ntalking about you.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000660061006E007400610073007400690063002000740069006D0069006E0067002100200057006500200077006500720065002000610063007400750061006C006C00790020006A007500730074000A00740061006C006B0069006E0067002000610062006F0075007400200079006F0075002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You were?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200077006500720065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why’s that?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800792019007300200074006800610074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We were just reminiscing on how much we and\nour Raichu all owe you!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065002000770065007200650020006A007500730074002000720065006D0069006E0069007300630069006E00670020006F006E00200068006F00770020006D00750063006800200077006500200061006E0064000A006F00750072002000520061006900630068007500200061006C006C0020006F0077006500200079006F00750021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here I am with the lovely Raichu I evolved from\nyour Pikachu by using a Thunder Stone on it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And here I am with the Raichu I received from you\nin our fortunate trade!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You see, we happened to pass one another on the\nstreet and stopped to admire each other’s Raichu.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Once we got to talking, we realized we both have\nyou to thank for them,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then we got so caught up in our excitement that\none thing led to another and...well, that’s how the<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nultimate Raichu duo came to be!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We never would have found each other if it\nweren’t for you and the magic of this city!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Biggah-biggahhh!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690067006700610068002D0062006900670067006100680068006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m going to use a Thunder Stone on every single\nPikachu I come across!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJust kidding, of course! I would never do that.\nNot me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All I need in my life is Raichu, and I’m set!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C002000490020006E00650065006400200069006E0020006D00790020006C0069006600650020006900730020005200610069006300680075002C00200061006E0064002000492019006D00200073006500740021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wonder which of the two is more wonderful—\nMega Raichu X or Mega Raichu Y?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, my dear Tracie! The world knows that all\nRaichu are perfectly wonderful!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Biga!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690067006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Biggah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420069006700670061006800210000",
